@* The layout: every view is drawn inside it unless it says '@layout none' or names another layout.
   The part before <body /> is drawn before the view; the part after it is drawn just before the view first
   waits for the user (an <input>, <select>, <checkbox> or <menu>), so it sits between the page content and
   what the user answers. *@
@* The app bar: where the user is (Home › About) on the left, the app name on the right.
   width="*" makes the first column take the space the second one leaves. *@
<columns gap="1">
    <column width="*"><breadcrumbs class="muted" /></column>
    <column><text class="muted">ConsoleMVC</text></column>
</columns>
<body />
<separator class="muted" />
@* The shortcuts mapped with app.MapKey in Program.cs that have a description *@
<shortcuts class="muted" />
